logix (1.1.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian/Ubuntu packaging of the Logix cross-platform core + CLI.
    Installs the logging bridge, report generator, SQL helper, Google Sheets
    sync, the SSH-login hook, and the "logix" command. Run "sudo logix
    configure" once after install.

